---
---
<section id="experience" class="section">

  <div class="spacer"></div>

  <span class="sec-label">Studies & Experience</span>

  <div class="entries">

    <div class="entry reveal">
      <div class="entry-left">
        <span class="entry-type mono">Education</span>
        <span class="entry-date mono">2023 – Present</span>
      </div>
      <div class="entry-right">
        <h3 class="entry-title">Computer Science</h3>
        <p class="entry-place mono">University of Deusto — Bilbao, Spain</p>
        <ul class="entry-bullets">
          <li>3rd year.</li>
          <li>Co-founder of 0xdecode community.</li>
          <ul class="entry-bullets">
            <li>English C1 course.</li>
            <li>Creation! Innovation and entrepreneurship.</li>
          </ul>
          
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="entry-divider"></div>

    <div class="entry reveal">
      <div class="entry-left">
        <span class="entry-type mono">Experience</span>
        <span class="entry-date mono">Dec 2025 – Present</span>
      </div>
      <div class="entry-right">
        <div class="entry-header">
          <h3 class="entry-title">SRE & DevOps Engineering Intern</h3>
          <span class="entry-tag">[CURRENT]</span>
        </div>
        <p class="entry-place mono">MasOrange — Bilbao, Spain</p>
        <ul class="entry-bullets">
          <li>Set up a production-grade local Kubernetes environment using kind. Deployed a containerised Python microservice with liveness/readiness probes, Deployment controllers, ReplicaSets, and ClusterIP Services.</li>
          <li>Deployed the full kube-prometheus-stack via Helm. Instrumented the app with a /metrics endpoint wired via ServiceMonitor CRD (automatic target discovery, no manual scrape config).</li>
          <li>Configured Alertmanager. Slack routing with Kubernetes Secrets, AlertmanagerConfig CRDs, and Go-template formatting.</li>
          <li><b>Building an Auto-Remediation Agent:</b> pattern-matching engine maps live alerts to a runbook catalog (OOMKilled, PodCrashLooping, DiskSpaceFull, ...) and executes fixes via the Kubernetes API.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <div class="spacer"></div>

</section>

<style>
  .entries {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .entry {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 140px 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
    padding: 1.75rem 0;
  }

  .entry-divider {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--light);
  }

  .entry-left {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.3rem;
    padding-top: 0.15rem;
  }

  .entry-type {
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--dark);
  }

  .entry-date {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--dark);
  }

  .entry-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
  }

  .entry-title {
    font-family: var(--font-sys);
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: bold;
  }

  .entry-tag {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    background: var(--black);
    color: var(--white);
    padding: 0.1rem 0.35rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .entry-place {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--dark);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .entry-bullets {
    padding-left: 1.1rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .entry-bullets li { list-style-type: square; }

  @media (max-width: 580px) {
    .entry { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 0.5rem; }
    .entry-left { flex-direction: row; gap: 1rem; }
  }
</style>